## Notes

One challenge I encountered was setting up navigation controllers correctly, especially connecting the "+" button to the correct screen for creating new tasks. I also had difficulty passing data between view controllers and ensuring tasks were saved properly using UserDefaults. Debugging storyboard connections and segues was a key part of completing this project.

